[{"id":"3905ac44","elType":"section","settings":{"hover_parallax":[{"layer_position_vr":{"unit":"%","size":30},"layer_position_hr":{"unit":"%","size":40},"_id":"b585d24"},{"layer_position_vr":{"unit":"%","size":60},"layer_position_hr":{"unit":"%","size":20},"_id":"973acda"}]},"elements":[{"id":"5c929836","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100},"elements":[{"id":"181dbafe","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Connix Cross-Market Data Suite</p><p>The Connix Cross-Market Data Suite expands the capabilities of our logic engine to handle diverse datasets simultaneously. It is engineered for analysts who need to understand the relationship between different market sectors.</p><p>Core Capabilities:</p><p>- Simultaneous Data Stream Processing: Analyzes up to 8 different financial instruments concurrently to identify leading and lagging relationships.<br />- Correlation Matrix: Visualizes how volatility in one asset class (e.g., Commodities) impacts price action in another (e.g., Currencies).<br />- Macro-Trend Verification: Uses data from multiple sectors to confirm the strength and validity of a broader economic trend.<br />Technical Specifications:</p><p>- High-Throughput Computation: Optimized to handle heavy data loads without latency.<br />- Inter-Market Logic: Algorithms designed specifically to detect flow of funds between different asset classes.<br />This tool is vital for constructing a holistic view of the global financial landscape</p>","text_color":"#B7CB51","align":"left","custom_css":".elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-default{
    color: white;
}


