[{"id":"3905ac44","elType":"section","settings":{"hover_parallax":[{"layer_position_vr":{"unit":"%","size":30},"layer_position_hr":{"unit":"%","size":40},"_id":"b585d24"},{"layer_position_vr":{"unit":"%","size":60},"layer_position_hr":{"unit":"%","size":20},"_id":"973acda"}]},"elements":[{"id":"5c929836","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100},"elements":[{"id":"181dbafe","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>The Algorithmic Market Structure Scanner is designed to streamline the research process by automating the search for high-probability market conditions. It filters through market noise to identify significant structural alignments.</p><p>Core Capabilities:</p><p>- Automated Data Screening: Continuously monitors real-time data feeds to highlight assets meeting specific structural criteria, reducing manual analysis time.<br />- Cyclic Pattern Recognition: Visualizes recurring data loops and volatility cycles to forecast potential market turning points.<br />- Statistical Confluence Detection: Identifies moments where multiple analytical models align, suggesting a statistically significant market event.<br />Technical Specifications:</p><p>- Real-Time Alerts: Provides instant notifications when specific data conditions are met.<br />- Customizable Parameters: Allows users to define their own scanning criteria based on volatility, volume, and time-based structures.<br />This tool empowers analysts to cover more ground and identify key opportunities without being glued to the screen</p>","text_color":"#B7CB51","align":"left","custom_css":".elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-default{
